{
    "title": "Village Medical",
    "description": "The Village Medical app is the easiest and fastest way to stay connected with your Village Medical care team 24/7. With the app, you can:\r\n\u2022 Live text chat with your Village Medical care team 24/7\r\n\u2022 Schedule appointments \r\n\u2022 Quickly access test results \u2013 sometimes in the same day\r\n\u2022 Have fast, easy and secure video visits\r\n\u2022 Get helpful support for managing chronic disease\r\n\r\nDownload the app before your next appointment. Get an Invitation Code from the front desk at your provider's office and start using the app right away.\r\n\r\nApp highlights:\r\n\r\nGET HELP WITH LIVE CHAT\r\nChat with your Village Medical care team 24/7 to get help with medications, labs, referrals, appointments and more, at no extra cost.\r\n\r\nBOOK A VISIT, VIDEO OR IN-OFFICE\r\nSimply tap the \"Book Visit\" tile and follow the instructions to search for and book a video or in-office visit with your Village Medical provider.\r\n\r\nSEND US A MESSAGE\r\nSend and receive messages with your provider and care team via the \"Inbox\" tab.\r\n\r\nACCESS YOUR HEALTH RECORDS\r\nTap on \u201cMy Health\u201d on the main navigation bar for quick access to your lab results, medications, post-visit summaries and care documents.\r\n\r\nIf you have any concerns about the information you see in the application, please consult with your Village Medical provider.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Village Medical app is the easiest and fastest way to stay connected with your Village Medical care team 24/7. With the app, you can:<br>\u2022 Live text chat with your Village Medical care team 24/7<br>\u2022 Schedule appointments <br>\u2022 Quickly access test results \u2013 sometimes in the same day<br>\u2022 Have fast, easy and secure video visits<br>\u2022 Get helpful support for managing chronic disease<br><br>Download the app before your next appointment. Get an Invitation Code from the front desk at your provider&#39;s office and start using the app right away.<br><br>App highlights:<br><br>GET HELP WITH LIVE CHAT<br>Chat with your Village Medical care team 24/7 to get help with medications, labs, referrals, appointments and more, at no extra cost.<br><br>BOOK A VISIT, VIDEO OR IN-OFFICE<br>Simply tap the &quot;Book Visit&quot; tile and follow the instructions to search for and book a video or in-office visit with your Village Medical provider.<br><br>SEND US A MESSAGE<br>Send and receive messages with your provider and care team via the &quot;Inbox&quot; tab.<br><br>ACCESS YOUR HEALTH RECORDS<br>Tap on \u201cMy Health\u201d on the main navigation bar for quick access to your lab results, medications, post-visit summaries and care documents.<br><br>If you have any concerns about the information you see in the application, please consult with your Village Medical provider.",
